  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.8.7: mutation fuzzing of the container, header, entropy, decoding and JPEG transcoding paths (custom mutator and AFL++ on x86 and arm64) and two fixes it found: a VarDCT DC stream with Modular transforms (RCT, palette, squeeze) read stale channels, and invalid colour encoding chromaticities raised a format error wrapping an ArgumentException. Decoded output of all other files and encoded bytes are unchanged. No API changes. See docs/releases/release-0.8.7.md and docs/design/0.8.7-fuzzing.md.",
